<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia June trade surplus at 574 mln rgt.</title>
<headline>Malaysia June trade surplus at 574 mln rgt.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia recorded a trade surplus of 574 million ringgit in June against a 238.2 million shortfall in May, the Statistics Department said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Exports for the month totalled 16.3 billion ringgit and imports valued at 15.7 billion, the national Bernama news agency quoted the department as saying.</p>
